Package: trafficmsd
Type: Package
Title: Multiscale Decomposition of Network Traffic
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Viliam", "Simko", email = "viliam.simko@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Multiscale decomposition of network traffic suitable
    for simulation such as using Queuing Petri Nets. Provides input
    validation, reproducible clustering, and tools for inspecting and
    reconstructing decomposed traffic signals.
